    "This connection was removed. Pick another one in the sidebar." : {

    },
    "This deletes every slot value, the journal of edits, the context documents, the translation memory and the saved run positions — the app-side session, for every project at once.\n\nIt stays: the project list, and every .xcstrings file. A catalog keeps the strings and the translations already written into it.\n\nWhat a re-scan cannot rebuild: the context documents and the translation memory are what the app LEARNED from your corrections, and this deletes them. Edits a window is still holding — anything not yet written to a file — go with the session.\n\nOpen catalogs re-read their files afterwards and read as untranslated work. The rows go in ONE pass, so even a large store is emptied in a second or two." : {

